  "item_short_desc": "<p>As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the Stealth Ops Soft Shell Jacket easily overcomes moderate to inclement weather conditions, suitable for fall and spring. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The lightweight performance fabric helps protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. This versatile coat is great for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "34",
  "description": "<p>As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell outerwear series, the Stealth Ops Soft Shell Jacket easily overcomes moderate to inclement weather conditions, suitable for fall and spring. The Soft Shell waterproof 3-layer fabric system deflects wind, retains heat, and releases moisture. The lightweight performance fabric helps protect and keep you comfortable while braving the elements. This versatile coat is great for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts. Comfortable Fleece Lining: The midweight tactical jacket features a soft fleece lining that keeps you warm, ideal for tactical outdoor operations and weekend adventures. In addition, the stand-up collar provides additional protection. High-Capacity Storage: The military soft shell stealth jacket comes equipped with 12 tactical pockets: 2 zipper shoulder pockets, left chest zipper pocket, 2 zipper hand pockets, and 7 inner utility pockets for storing tactical gear, communications equipment, and outdoor essentials. Utility at the Forefront: The tactical soft shell jacket features underarm ventilation zippers that ensure optimal comfort by allowing air circulation. The drawstring waist and adjustable wrist cuffs provide a perfect fit, while the two-way zipper offers quick and easy access. In addition, the 2 shoulder loop fields allow you to easily wear patches. Action Ready: From the field to the forest, the soft shell coat offers exceptional utility and double-layer reinforced forearms that are great for withstanding tactical missions and outdoor expeditions.</p>",
